# Vendored third-party files are kept byte-identical to upstream in the
# repository, but the two largest groups of files exist only to render the
# upstream project's own README on a registry page. Excluding them here keeps
# the repository faithful while sparing every installer 417 KB of decoration.
#
# Nothing under `src/`, `themes/`, or `lib.typ` is excluded: those are the files
# the compiler actually imports.
assets/
changelog.md
